<view class="page danger-page">
  <view class="safe-top"></view><view class="topbar"><view class="back" bindtap="back"><image class="figma-back" src="/assets/figma/all/s04-imgFrame.svg"/></view><view class="top-title"><view class="top-title-main">安全判断</view><view class="top-title-sub">第 1 步，共 4 步</view></view></view>
  <view class="progress"><view class="progress-fill" style="width:25%"></view></view>
  <view class="danger-reminder"><view class="danger-reminder-icon">!</view><view class="grow"><view class="danger-reminder-title">先确认危险信号</view><view class="danger-reminder-copy">如有呼吸困难、晕厥等情况，请立即求助。</view></view></view>
  <view class="h2 danger-question">现在是否出现以下任一情况？</view><view class="danger-text" style="margin:12rpx 0 28rpx">请按当前最严重的状态选择</view>
  <view class="stack gap-12"><view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" class="field {{item.selected ? 'danger-selected' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="toggle"><view class="circle circle-red danger-icon"><text wx:if="{{item.mark}}" class="danger-mark">{{item.mark}}</text><image wx:else class="icon-svg" src="{{item.icon}}" mode="aspectFit"/></view><view class="grow" style="margin-left:22rpx"><view class="field-value">{{item.title}}</view><view class="tiny">{{item.desc}}</view></view><image wx:if="{{item.selected}}" class="figma-icon sm" src="/assets/figma/all/s04-imgEllipse3.svg"/></view></view>
  <view style="margin-top:60rpx"><button class="danger-btn" bindtap="emergency">有，立即进入紧急求助</button><button class="primary-btn" style="margin-top:20rpx" bindtap="continueFlow">没有以上情况，继续判断</button><view class="safe-note" style="margin-top:24rpx">不确定时请选择“有”，优先保障安全<text class="block-break"></text>本工具不替代医疗诊断</view></view>
</view>
